741
00:30:19,010 --> 00:30:20,510
- So, anyway,
I'm flying one of those

742
00:30:20,510 --> 00:30:23,010
new flying carpets they've got,
and it's great.

743
00:30:23,020 --> 00:30:25,020
- Enjoy the only exterior shot.

744
00:30:28,020 --> 00:30:29,530
