745
00:30:29,520 --> 00:30:31,520
Ha, they've got the west
grass skirt night.

746
00:30:31,530 --> 00:30:34,030
Enjoy the fentoozler
and keep the cup.

747
00:30:35,030 --> 00:30:37,030
- Uh, Donner,
party of three, please.

748
00:30:37,030 --> 00:30:43,040
<i>- ♪ That summer night
I chanced to pass you by ♪</i>

749
00:30:43,040 --> 00:30:45,040
- Mm-hm.

750
00:30:45,040 --> 00:30:46,540
<i>- ♪ I smiled at you ♪
- ♪ They smiled at you ♪</i>

751
00:30:47,040 --> 00:30:49,050
- ♪ He smiled at me ♪

752
00:30:49,040 --> 00:30:51,540
- ♪ We all smiled
At each other ♪

753
00:30:51,550 --> 00:30:53,050
- ♪ We smiled ♪

754
00:30:53,050 --> 00:30:54,550
- ♪ Ba-bum ♪

755
00:30:54,550 --> 00:30:58,050
- You know, that piano player
is not bad-- and the girl.

756
00:30:58,050 --> 00:31:00,060
I'll probably get her.
Dig it.

757
00:31:02,560 --> 00:31:07,560
<i>- ♪ You possess me
so completely ♪</i>

758
00:31:07,560 --> 00:31:09,070
- Mm-hm.
- Uh, excuse me.

759
00:31:09,060 --> 00:31:11,060
Are you our waitress?

760
00:31:11,060 --> 00:31:13,060
I'd like to order whatever
