00:56:05,790 --> 00:56:08,800
- Oh, darn.

1409
00:56:08,790 --> 00:56:11,790
Oh, what a bad time
to break a heel.

1410
00:56:20,810 --> 00:56:23,310
- Then I came upon
a sanitary landfill.

1411
00:56:23,310 --> 00:56:25,310
I knew civilization
must be near.

1412
00:56:30,320 --> 00:56:32,820
GRETA:  <i>It wasn't long after
I started through the jungle</i>

1413
00:56:32,820 --> 00:56:35,320
