1416
00:56:39,830 --> 00:56:41,330
GRETA:  <i>But suddenly
they started to kneel</i>

1417
00:56:41,330 --> 00:56:43,330
<i>in an attitude of worship.</i>

1418
00:56:43,330 --> 00:56:46,840
